data: {"id": "5f3f0c2f8e5f4e75-final", "run_id": "5f3f0c2f8e5f4e75", "seq": 792, "ts_ms": 1789062855896, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh in namespace aiops-case-05 is stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus (Namespace: aiops-case-05) | 46次 `NoNetworkFound` 警告，明确指出 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`（时间跨度：2s - 60m） | 确凿证据：证明 Multus 持续无法解析 Pod 引用的网络资源 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet (Namespace: aiops-case-05) | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，错误详情：`plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition ... \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 确凿证据：展示 Kubelet 因底层 CNI 失败而拒绝创建沙箱 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubelet | 容器 `app` 状态维持在 `ContainerCreating`，等待理由为 `ContainerCreating` | 现象证据：证实 Pod 处于卡滞状态，未能推进到 Running |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 辅助证据：外部指标验证了 Pod 确实处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nMultus CNI 和 Kubelet 发出的两个不同维度的 K8s Event（#1, #2）均指向完全相同的缺失资源 `unavailable-network`，这种跨组件的事实一致性强有力地锁定了配置错误。Metric 和 K8s State 分别独立观测到了 Pod 无法启动的现象（#3, #4），与事件日志描述的状态完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失网络资源 'unavailable-network' (Namespace: aiops-case-05) → Multus CNI 失败解析网络委托 → Kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡滞在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：缺失网络定义资源导致 Multus 网络初始化失败。**\n\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 在创建过程中配置了 Multus 网络引用，但其命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源（见证据 #1 和 #2）。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件无法初始化网络，进而触发 Kubelet 拒绝创建 Pod 沙箱，最终导致 Pod 无限期停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 #3 和 #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 45.1s (Evidence 36.8s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.377, "metrics": {"run_id": "5f3f0c2f8e5f4e75", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.38347578048706, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73383.47578048706, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 64501.09243392944, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_ca